# Dark Fortress after the turn it entered. On turn 3 Bot1 controls only a Blood Crypt (Swamp and Mountain types but not
# basic, CR 205.4a) and Bot2 controls an Island (not Bot1's): {R} is refused (the refusal) while {C} is still offered. On
# turn 5 a basic Swamp of Bot1's turns the ability back on (the positive control: the same action, the same land).

[Bot1 Deck]
Dark Fortress
Blood Crypt
Swamp
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Dark Fortress.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Blood Crypt.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Fortress.Activate(Ability: or; Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Fortress.Activate(Ability: {C})
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Fortress.Activate(Ability: or; Color: Red)

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {R}
